曾煥嘉議員親赴現場勘查迅速協助</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">圖:新北市議員曾煥嘉 趕赴板新鳳翔社區進行實地勘查。(圖/曾煥嘉服務處提供) (記者張耀元報導) 位於板橋精華 […]</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">獨家報導 ・ 18 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>發表留言</span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-5 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] h-auto lg:h-auto"><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;23f65f19-b466-387f-9ffa-4139192c208d&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:3,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;謝龍介PK陳亭妃！ 最新台南市長選舉網路投票跌破眼鏡&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:3;ct:story;g:23f65f19-b466-387f-9ffa-4139192c208d;slk:謝龍介PK陳亭妃！ 最新台南市長選舉網路投票跌破眼鏡;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="謝龍介PK陳亭妃！ 最新台南市長選舉網路投票跌破眼鏡" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%AC%9D%E9%BE%8D%E4%BB%8Bpk%E9%99%B3%E4%BA%AD%E5%A6%83-%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E5%8F%B0%E5%8D%97%E5%B8%82%E9%95%B7%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E7%B6%B2%E8%B7%AF%E6%8A%95%E7%A5%A8%E8%B7%8C%E7%A0%B4%E7%9C%BC%E9%8F%A1-092357389.html">謝龍介PK陳亭妃！ 最新台南市長選舉網路投票跌破眼鏡</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">2026年台南市長選舉，國民黨提名立委謝龍介挑戰市長大位，民進黨則派出立委陳亭妃延續綠色執政。而在今（19）日，入口網站《Yahoo奇摩新聞》以台南市長選戰相關話題為題發起網路投票，結果顯示，表態支持謝龍介的參與者雖多於支持陳亭妃的，但有高達3成9的參與者回答「不知道／沒意見」，為所有選項最高。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">中時新聞網 ・ 1 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>發表留言</span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6A79051EC4199F55495E3E372035824EAE1297EE033B44167A626D2646DFBA62/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F71bac70e1e42e3d19d03f7f6f5d85475.png"/><img alt="超過3萬人擠爆造勢會場！ 張善政忍不住開轟「洋流有政見嗎？都在搗亂」！" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3E28C1082F0AE061A8F90D0CE875FF4453C137E43237E2D440FA62B6918C5336/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F71bac70e1e42e3d19d03f7f6f5d85475.png"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;1184c3fa-beca-39a1-959a-7699a6f1fa5b&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:4,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;超過3萬人擠爆造勢會場！ 張善政忍不住開轟「洋流有政見嗎？都在搗亂」！&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:4;ct:story;g:1184c3fa-beca-39a1-959a-7699a6f1fa5b;slk:超過3萬人擠爆造勢會場！ 張善政忍不住開轟「洋流有政見嗎？都在搗亂」！;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="超過3萬人擠爆造勢會場！ 張善政忍不住開轟「洋流有政見嗎？都在搗亂」！" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B6%85%E9%81%8E3%E8%90%AC%E4%BA%BA%E6%93%A0%E7%88%86%E9%80%A0%E5%8B%A2%E6%9C%83%E5%A0%B4-%E5%BC%B5%E5%96%84%E6%94%BF%E5%BF%8D%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%8F%E9%96%8B%E8%BD%9F-%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81%E6%9C%89%E6%94%BF%E8%A6%8B%E5%97%8E-%E9%83%BD%E5%9C%A8%E6%90%97%E4%BA%82-135933091.html">超過3萬人擠爆造勢會場！ 張善政忍不住開轟「洋流有政見嗎？都在搗亂」！</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">桃園市長張善政今（17）日晚間舉辦大型造勢活動，藍白大咖齊聚相挺，現場更湧入3萬人。張善政表示，選舉時總會遭到抹黑，自己最近也被唱衰到差一點懷疑人生，「哪有唱衰自己城市市政建設的？桃園不是國民黨的、不是民進黨的，是大家的桃園！」</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">中天新聞網 ・ 1 天前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>86<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8F1BA69A70DE7DC9580A056B8341331ECD7BF1E05FDCA6997EF22D86AC9CBB58/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fc2381d51e3ead491b7d2fb75dd8d44ee.jpg"/><img alt="沈伯洋交鋒黃光芹「大腦高速運轉」！遭猛攻「噴1句神回」她秒變臉大倒戈" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9C5109342F5EE62D0F00CB92FCBCDD8FEAD622CA06A8141E9C33E2EEA46E8407/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fc2381d51e3ead491b7d2fb75dd8d44ee.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;b8100959-9a5e-358c-b41a-3266d03047a1&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:5,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;沈伯洋交鋒黃光芹「大腦高速運轉」！遭猛攻「噴1句神回」她秒變臉大倒戈&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:5;ct:story;g:b8100959-9a5e-358c-b41a-3266d03047a1;slk:沈伯洋交鋒黃光芹「大腦高速運轉」！遭猛攻「噴1句神回」她秒變臉大倒戈;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="沈伯洋交鋒黃光芹「大腦高速運轉」！遭猛攻「噴1句神回」她秒變臉大倒戈" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E4%BA%A4%E9%8B%92%E9%BB%83%E5%85%89%E8%8A%B9-%E5%A4%A7%E8%85%A6%E9%AB%98%E9%80%9F%E9%81%8B%E8%BD%89-%E9%81%AD%E7%8C%9B%E6%94%BB-%E5%99%B41%E5%8F%A5%E7%A5%9E%E5%9B%9E-%E5%A5%B9%E7%A7%92%E8%AE%8A%E8%87%89%E5%A4%A7%E5%80%92%E6%88%88-091240385.html">沈伯洋交鋒黃光芹「大腦高速運轉」！遭猛攻「噴1句神回」她秒變臉大倒戈</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">政治中心／綜合報導民進黨台北市長候選人沈伯洋今（19日）一早行程滿檔，先是接受資深媒體人吳淡如專訪，談起已故生母往事，讓不少線上收聽的網友聽到落淚，隨後又馬不停蹄趕場黃光芹主持的節目，沒想到這場專訪氣氛大不同！黃光芹不僅頻頻被沈伯洋逗得笑出聲，還一度開玩笑吃醋，虧他回答另一位主持人陳儀潔的問題比較好，沈伯洋隨後更在回答政策發想初衷時，突然順著脈絡提到選舉最初有不少策略，其中當初為了提高知名度，決定「趕快來光芹姐的節目」，讓黃光芹當場笑到拍手，開心直喊：「你還記得我喔！」這段互動畫面曝光後，也讓網友笑翻：「撲馬根本就是長輩最喜歡的體質啊～」。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 1 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>14<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-5 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/CF457F55D078D1C2646BC8B8FB2C164A2A5C6AA6B5EC34F499B989C184CE4950/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F55aab8f145b4e6a4938645bafcddcb1f.jpg"/><img alt="沈伯洋、蔣萬安台北激戰！黃暐瀚曝：3者到位「這人是1128當選人」" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7B83FBE685E1756848E9C5854F7919040E9647DF4DC980AF32CE17D6FF4BEE8C/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F55aab8f145b4e6a4938645bafcddcb1f.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;ffb46140-0af6-30ef-a120-e67ee3b4cfdd&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:7,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;沈伯洋、蔣萬安台北激戰！黃暐瀚曝：3者到位「這人是1128當選人」&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:7;ct:story;g:ffb46140-0af6-30ef-a120-e67ee3b4cfdd;slk:沈伯洋、蔣萬安台北激戰！黃暐瀚曝：3者到位「這人是1128當選人」;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="沈伯洋、蔣萬安台北激戰！黃暐瀚曝：3者到位「這人是1128當選人」" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E6%BF%80%E6%88%B0-%E9%BB%83%E6%9A%90%E7%80%9A%E6%9B%9D-3%E8%80%85%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%8D-%E9%80%99%E4%BA%BA%E6%98%AF1128%E7%95%B6%E9%81%B8%E4%BA%BA-072223893.html">沈伯洋、蔣萬安台北激戰！黃暐瀚曝：3者到位「這人是1128當選人」</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">即時中心／潘柏廷報導民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋，投入選戰以來，藉由掃街拜票、流利口才點出現今市政問題，再加上接受非同溫層的資深媒體人王偉忠等人專訪，逐漸在首都掀起「洋流」旋風；甚至在最新民調顯示，他與對手、國民黨籍市長蔣萬安僅差8%，引發各界高度關注。對此，資深媒體人黃暐瀚今（19）日在臉書指出，只要3者到位，沈伯洋將是11月28日的台北市長當選人。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 3 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>85<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1F2B4A57B42983DE12A6FB493B64D2EBAF0142645F54E94143EF7DA08B2A3D74/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fc43e82984ee48442a64a911e741a07b6.jpg"/><img alt="沈伯洋有望逆轉勝！日媒曝蔣萬安「3致命傷」：苦戰也是輸" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1C48F74C06EE09F0FB8BADA6299B1C7EC2000584B06C4EDF1F047749FD604734/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fc43e82984ee48442a64a911e741a07b6.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;5d478b9a-c625-3335-b4a0-0c0a3860b60f&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:8,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;沈伯洋有望逆轉勝！日媒曝蔣萬安「3致命傷」：苦戰也是輸&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:8;ct:story;g:5d478b9a-c625-3335-b4a0-0c0a3860b60f;slk:沈伯洋有望逆轉勝！日媒曝蔣萬安「3致命傷」：苦戰也是輸;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="沈伯洋有望逆轉勝！日媒曝蔣萬安「3致命傷」：苦戰也是輸" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%9B%E9%80%86%E8%BD%89%E5%8B%9D-%E6%97%A5%E5%AA%92%E6%9B%9D%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89-3%E8%87%B4%E5%91%BD%E5%82%B7-%E8%8B%A6%E6%88%B0%E4%B9%9F%E6%98%AF%E8%BC%B8-093707967.html">沈伯洋有望逆轉勝！日媒曝蔣萬安「3致命傷」：苦戰也是輸</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">政治中心／綜合報導台北市長選戰不僅國內關注，連日本媒體也高度矚目！日本知名時事資訊節目近日針對北市選情進行深入分析，邀請前《朝日新聞》台北分社社長ｘ野嶋剛剖析戰況。野嶋剛直言，現任市長蔣萬安原本勝券在握，如今卻面臨「這 3 大致命傷」，導致選情遭到民進黨推出的參選人沈伯洋緊逼，陷入意料之外的苦戰。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 1 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>1<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/BC813077BB6D70A662E2204FA875B1007D59E731CB6A6CA873C6C4E5028667B4/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fstormmediagroup.com%2F27d3d539f373becba84201e3050354f5"/><img alt="「洋流」聲勢浩大都是空氣票？醫預言「綠營恐一屍多命」：最大苦主是她" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/FC9ED3D2B4770EC489E936EE5D4C8A0A6FF79F28733ADD263BE87CC9F8046D8B/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fstormmediagroup.com%2F27d3d539f373becba84201e3050354f5"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;08c0c541-dec5-3520-99ca-33ad16f52d0d&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:9,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;「洋流」聲勢浩大都是空氣票？醫預言「綠營恐一屍多命」：最大苦主是她&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:9;ct:story;g:08c0c541-dec5-3520-99ca-33ad16f52d0d;slk:「洋流」聲勢浩大都是空氣票？醫預言「綠營恐一屍多命」：最大苦主是她;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="「洋流」聲勢浩大都是空氣票？醫預言「綠營恐一屍多命」：最大苦主是她" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81-%E8%81%B2%E5%8B%A2%E6%B5%A9%E5%A4%A7%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E7%A9%BA%E6%B0%A3%E7%A5%A8-%E9%86%AB%E9%A0%90%E8%A8%80-%E7%B6%A0%E7%87%9F%E6%81%90-%E5%B1%8D%E5%A4%9A%E5%91%BD-060630845.html">「洋流」聲勢浩大都是空氣票？醫預言「綠營恐一屍多命」：最大苦主是她</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">2026九合一選戰進入倒數階段，台北市長選情白熱化，民進黨參選人沈伯洋近來掃街、造勢所到之處人潮洶湧，被認為是「洋流崛起」。不過，胸腔科醫師蘇一峰在臉書發文表示，「洋流全台亂衝」無法轉化成選票，恐導致綠營「一屍多命」，新北市長參選人蘇巧慧成最大苦主。針對近來洋流崛起的討論，蘇一峰直言，洋流亂衝無法轉化為選票，綠營恐面臨一屍多命。洋流熱潮壓縮其他縣市綠營聲量，......</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">風傳媒 ・ 5 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>104<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-5 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/D6A31826242793FC70E8965797412272288F98BBF1BEA211D747903ED1F3D39A/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fnewtalk.tw%2F915e0fad10c3a164b621626ee05ef190.png"/><img alt="最新台北市長選戰調查出爐！ 「這人」領先近兩成碾壓對手..." class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/92BE382674850A838109CD1FA065AF4C44846FFC79DC0B2A67A6E2B00F3AB513/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fnewtalk.tw%2F915e0fad10c3a164b621626ee05ef190.png"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;9199b37c-74f9-3889-bba5-3cd5a77da3ec&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:11,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;最新台北市長選戰調查出爐！ 「這人」領先近兩成碾壓對手...&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:11;ct:story;g:9199b37c-74f9-3889-bba5-3cd5a77da3ec;slk:最新台北市長選戰調查出爐！ 「這人」領先近兩成碾壓對手...;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="最新台北市長選戰調查出爐！ 「這人」領先近兩成碾壓對手..." class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E5%B8%82%E9%95%B7%E9%81%B8%E6%88%B0%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5%E5%87%BA%E7%88%90-%E9%80%99%E4%BA%BA-%E9%A0%98%E5%85%88%E8%BF%91%E5%85%A9%E6%88%90%E7%A2%BE%E5%A3%93%E5%B0%8D%E6%89%8B-233436340.html">最新台北市長選戰調查出爐！ 「這人」領先近兩成碾壓對手...</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">[Newtalk新聞] 距離九合一選舉提票日剩四十日。其中，在台北市市長選戰部分，國民黨由現任市長蔣萬安拼連任；民進黨則由立委沈伯洋應戰。根據一項最新調查，「這人」竟近領先近兩成碾壓對手。 《壹蘋新聞網》近日發起以「倒數6週，你支持誰當台北市長？」為題之網路投票，投票時間為本月11日至16日止，共有5,045人參與。結果顯示，沈伯洋以56.1%居首；蔣萬安以41.5%居次；另有2.4%表示「尚未決定」。沈伯洋與蔣萬安兩人支持度相差14.7個百分點。 不過，網路投票涉及的不確定因素極多，至多只能作為觀察網友態度的參考，較難作為判斷實際選舉輿情的依據。若要關注相關選舉輿情變化，建議仍應參考各家民調機構、媒體民調中心，或委託專業民調機構所進行的民意調查。查看原文更多Newtalk新聞報導沈伯洋很氣「我是犯罪學所長」 蔣萬安：你專業是認知作戰 沈伯洋：我是「認知作戰」專家、但蔣萬安跟我應是同一國人</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">Newtalk新聞 ・ 11 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>125<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2AF39C546EF9E31ACB6EB4551DA660686B28E95D69750C75A4233B560C9DCEE3/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Ffafa00b12d9e1b5d08899e2d419844ed.jpg"/><img alt="昔日支持者跑了？詹江村「驚見1幕」喊：首次感受到必須被搶救的危機" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/BAF9B3237DDF3F187FA545B55E4344E8EE01456E5B68EAFA0326DA74215D5587/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Ffafa00b12d9e1b5d08899e2d419844ed.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;0b6694f6-3962-3193-ab65-137da748b94f&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:12,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;昔日支持者跑了？詹江村「驚見1幕」喊：首次感受到必須被搶救的危機&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:12;ct:story;g:0b6694f6-3962-3193-ab65-137da748b94f;slk:昔日支持者跑了？詹江村「驚見1幕」喊：首次感受到必須被搶救的危機;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="昔日支持者跑了？詹江村「驚見1幕」喊：首次感受到必須被搶救的危機" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%98%94%E6%97%A5%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E8%80%85%E8%B7%91%E4%BA%86-%E8%A9%B9%E6%B1%9F%E6%9D%91-%E9%A9%9A%E8%A6%8B1%E5%B9%95-%E5%96%8A-%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E6%84%9F%E5%8F%97%E5%88%B0%E5%BF%85%E9%A0%88%E8%A2%AB%E6%90%B6%E6%95%91%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%B1%E6%A9%9F-050200407.html">昔日支持者跑了？詹江村「驚見1幕」喊：首次感受到必須被搶救的危機</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">2026桃園市議員選舉戰況激烈，國民黨現任議員詹江村爭取連任桃園區，面對20人搶12席的大混戰，他坦言首次感受到強烈危機感。詹江村透露，多位歷次選舉的重要支持者與軍中長官竟出現在對手造勢台上，加上多位藍綠及民眾黨強敵夾擊，目前民調落入C段班。他呼籲支持者團結搶救，切勿分票，確保議會關鍵戰將能順利連任。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">三立新聞網 setn.com ・ 6 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>8<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8E89CAA29A37973AA36AE0AC24FE740F74CB2632E007B02CEFDAA67827386DB3/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Flibertytimes_786%2F5bbc22ea09d92255a81a6fbac4f023ee.jpg"/><img alt="財神眷顧？澎湖男連中2次「千萬發票」 銀行拒兌報警處理" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/FB90C253B267F6933D203E9CEDD3A946499C447A93387F9D5C79187A0CA17492/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Flibertytimes_786%2F5bbc22ea09d92255a81a6fbac4f023ee.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;7f28418c-96b8-3326-a2f3-eee42d815c65&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:13,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;財神眷顧？澎湖男連中2次「千萬發票」 銀行拒兌報警處理&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:13;ct:story;g:7f28418c-96b8-3326-a2f3-eee42d815c65;slk:財神眷顧？澎湖男連中2次「千萬發票」 銀行拒兌報警處理;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="財神眷顧？澎湖男連中2次「千萬發票」 銀行拒兌報警處理" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B2%A1%E7%A5%9E%E7%9C%B7%E9%A1%A7-%E6%BE%8E%E6%B9%96%E7%94%B7%E9%80%A3%E4%B8%AD2%E6%AC%A1-%E5%8D%83%E8%90%AC%E7%99%BC%E7%A5%A8-%E9%8A%80%E8%A1%8C%E6%8B%92%E5%85%8C%E5%A0%B1%E8%AD%A6%E8%99%95%E7%90%86-083708493.html">財神眷顧？澎湖男連中2次「千萬發票」 銀行拒兌報警處理</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">幸運之神接連2次降臨同1人，是巧合，還是事有蹊蹺？澎湖發生1起同1人連中5-6月、7-8月統一發票千萬特別獎，另還有多張小獎，其中小獎多已在超商兌換，但領超過千元以上金額，必須在銀行或農會兌領，遭銀行拒兌並報警處理，但據了解發票是真的、並非偽造，因此案情仍有待釐清。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">自由時報 ・ 2 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>18<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-5 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6FC15054AA14421FD3BB1756579CEF08763FDCC9A9B511154F7506EBD6454CAD/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2F119a96796437adcef46480f42243daa7.jpg"/><img alt="柯文哲完蛋了　大帳房李文宗認罪與柯掏空眾望基金會" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8D51E65174DB4968F233522C23AFCB590F1FEA1A159FE606E07B201911AE0C19/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2F119a96796437adcef46480f42243daa7.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;1e797b2b-c2ec-3d2c-b029-b74ee603f49b&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:15,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;柯文哲完蛋了　大帳房李文宗認罪與柯掏空眾望基金會&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:15;ct:story;g:1e797b2b-c2ec-3d2c-b029-b74ee603f49b;slk:柯文哲完蛋了　大帳房李文宗認罪與柯掏空眾望基金會;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="柯文哲完蛋了　大帳房李文宗認罪與柯掏空眾望基金會" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9F%AF%E6%96%87%E5%93%B2%E5%AE%8C%E8%9B%8B%E4%BA%86-%E5%A4%A7%E5%B8%B3%E6%88%BF%E6%9D%8E%E6%96%87%E5%AE%97%E8%AA%8D%E7%BD%AA%E8%88%87%E6%9F%AF%E6%8E%8F%E7%A9%BA%E7%9C%BE%E6%9C%9B%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E6%9C%83-070800907.html">柯文哲完蛋了　大帳房李文宗認罪與柯掏空眾望基金會</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">高等法院今（19日）針對民眾黨前主席柯文哲涉及侵佔政治獻及掏空眾望基金會案再度開庭，李文宗確定認罪，坦承與柯文哲挪用眾望基金會公款210萬元給柯文哲的貼身帳房許芷瑜（橘子、潛逃通緝中）、黃心緗等4個未到基金會工作，實際從事柯競選活動人員。此外李文娟也傳出有意認罪。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">鏡週刊Mirror Media ・ 4 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>47<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/990EBA1A56113BEDF715ADA8210BFFAA7410B56B92134841FBEA904A10445A08/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Ffountmedia_io_269%2Fcec6d4909d412e88779a45540b1c4210"/><img alt="遭徐巧芯嗆「我們會贏」的蔣萬安學弟楊盛安發長文談沈伯洋：同在永吉路長大，「他從來沒有離開過五分埔」！憶復興校園的民主啟蒙與台語歧視" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E178B6A220C338C1B4B1A958BA6D204FEDA66A5136103DE644815545112E2BD7/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Ffountmedia_io_269%2Fcec6d4909d412e88779a45540b1c4210"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;99d3e6a9-804c-3693-8619-a85e8636fb3f&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:16,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;遭徐巧芯嗆「我們會贏」的蔣萬安學弟楊盛安發長文談沈伯洋：同在永吉路長大，「他從來沒有離開過五分埔」！憶復興校園的民主啟蒙與台語歧視&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:16;ct:story;g:99d3e6a9-804c-3693-8619-a85e8636fb3f;slk:遭徐巧芯嗆「我們會贏」的蔣萬安學弟楊盛安發長文談沈伯洋：同在永吉路長大，「他從來沒有離開過五分埔」！憶復興校園的民主啟蒙與台語歧視;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="遭徐巧芯嗆「我們會贏」的蔣萬安學弟楊盛安發長文談沈伯洋：同在永吉路長大，「他從來沒有離開過五分埔」！憶復興校園的民主啟蒙與台語歧視" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%81%AD%E5%BE%90%E5%B7%A7%E8%8A%AF%E5%97%86-%E6%88%91%E5%80%91%E6%9C%83%E8%B4%8F-%E7%9A%84%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E5%AD%B8%E5%BC%9F%E6%A5%8A%E7%9B%9B%E5%AE%89%E7%99%BC%E9%95%B7%E6%96%87%E8%AB%87%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%90%8C%E5%9C%A8%E6%B0%B8%E5%90%89%E8%B7%AF%E9%95%B7%E5%A4%A7-%E4%BB%96%E5%BE%9E%E4%BE%86%E6%B2%92%E6%9C%89%E9%9B%A2%E9%96%8B%E9%81%8E%E4%BA%94%E5%88%86%E5%9F%94-222920751.html">遭徐巧芯嗆「我們會贏」的蔣萬安學弟楊盛安發長文談沈伯洋：同在永吉路長大，「他從來沒有離開過五分埔」！憶復興校園的民主啟蒙與台語歧視</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">「他從來沒有離開過五分埔。」10月18日上午，帶著兩個兒子的楊盛安，當面向台北市長蔣萬安表明自己是學弟，但這次支持沈伯洋，一旁的國民黨立委徐巧芯隨即接話「我們還是會贏」。楊盛安隨後在臉書發表長文，分享支持沈伯洋的原因：兩人同在永吉路一帶長大，看到沈伯洋走訪社區，細數水果攤、麵線與油飯店，熟悉的街坊記憶讓他感受到，即使沈伯洋赴美求學、搬家、當上立委，始終沒有離開成長的地方。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">放言 Fount Media ・ 12 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>38<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/D998463E6D1E1B6337EA58D8B1A87C3E6DD07F8E9DE4B062985D4A6D013135A4/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fc1a9b3d98c3bdcf40d86ccdfd518a560.jpg"/><img alt="洋流變海嘯！台北市長民調將揭曉「戴立安脫口1大實話」急喊卡" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/48CA993D57A3ED78E0B1F4BE37D55E95A9B5595906A3368FD0756CB4EC3776BC/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2Fc1a9b3d98c3bdcf40d86ccdfd518a560.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;3d136d68-d235-329a-a344-3d4f3b132008&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:17,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;洋流變海嘯！台北市長民調將揭曉「戴立安脫口1大實話」急喊卡&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:17;ct:story;g:3d136d68-d235-329a-a344-3d4f3b132008;slk:洋流變海嘯！台北市長民調將揭曉「戴立安脫口1大實話」急喊卡;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="洋流變海嘯！台北市長民調將揭曉「戴立安脫口1大實話」急喊卡" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81%E8%AE%8A%E6%B5%B7%E5%98%AF-%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E5%B8%82%E9%95%B7%E6%B0%91%E8%AA%BF%E5%B0%87%E6%8F%AD%E6%9B%89-%E6%88%B4%E7%AB%8B%E5%AE%89%E8%84%AB%E5%8F%A31%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%A6%E8%A9%B1-%E6%80%A5%E5%96%8A%E5%8D%A1-072524424.html">洋流變海嘯！台北市長民調將揭曉「戴立安脫口1大實話」急喊卡</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">政治中心／綜合報導2026九合一大選進入倒數，台北市長蔣萬安力拚連任，民進黨參選人沈伯洋則持續帶動「洋流」話題，雙方選情受到外界關注，台北市信民兩岸研究協會今（19日）正式預告，將於明（20日）公布最新一波台北市長民調，這也是繼9月雙方支持度僅差1.2個百分點後，再度針對首都市長選戰進行調查，民調專家戴立安更在日前忍不住透露，新數據與9月中旬相比「應該也還會是有一個落差」，並點名這波「洋流效應」其實是蔣萬安與沈伯洋兩人共同創造，如今民調公布時間正式敲定，也讓外界關注台北選情是否出現新的變化。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 3 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>55<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-5 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/A39C57B3D11DC17781A121D1B25A8EF18E5C8D44DD29ADF109C25938A5A9BA9C/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Ffb430839a7b9c419a8a71ef42cb0fd65.jpg"/><img alt="颱風假掰了？薔琵最新路徑預測又北修、東修！氣象署估「不侵襲」" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/64F2275466FABA80A6F16A5CDE95E6F51754A9980FA28AE00815263A5FAEA1A6/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Ffb430839a7b9c419a8a71ef42cb0fd65.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;257142f1-19ea-398b-b543-5fe8c06fee4e&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:19,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;颱風假掰了？薔琵最新路徑預測又北修、東修！氣象署估「不侵襲」&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:19;ct:story;g:257142f1-19ea-398b-b543-5fe8c06fee4e;slk:颱風假掰了？薔琵最新路徑預測又北修、東修！氣象署估「不侵襲」;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="颱風假掰了？薔琵最新路徑預測又北修、東修！氣象署估「不侵襲」" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%A2%B1%E9%A2%A8%E5%81%87%E6%8E%B0%E4%BA%86-%E8%96%94%E7%90%B5%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%91%E9%A0%90%E6%B8%AC%E5%8F%88%E5%8C%97%E4%BF%AE-%E6%9D%B1%E4%BF%AE-%E6%B0%A3%E8%B1%A1%E7%BD%B2%E4%BC%B0-%E4%B8%8D%E4%BE%B5%E8%A5%B2-083600806.html">颱風假掰了？薔琵最新路徑預測又北修、東修！氣象署估「不侵襲」</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">薔琵颱風朝西北西移動接近台灣東方海面，氣象署最新預報顯示其路徑北修且「不侵襲」台灣。明各地多雲到晴最熱，週三起東北季風增強使北部轉涼並有雨。週五至下週日受颱風外圍環流影響，北部及東北部將有陣雨並伴隨局部大雨或豪雨，請民眾多加留意天氣變化並預做防範準備。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">三立新聞網 setn.com ・ 2 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>16<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/16DBC4C0E13B66F6315D51975D06748A90D554213A90FBDE9983CB7D444871BB/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2Fbfab7a8c239a4d1695032a90af587595.png"/><img alt="蔣萬安戰沈伯洋！這區最新街頭民調結果跌破眼鏡" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/C9848496C39F43425D6C55616E99905C7A7FB2A16C05D6012AF22A8BE3BF72F8/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2Fbfab7a8c239a4d1695032a90af587595.png"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;ac846b04-f2af-39d1-8a25-9b32d43e3a71&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:20,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;蔣萬安戰沈伯洋！這區最新街頭民調結果跌破眼鏡&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:20;ct:story;g:ac846b04-f2af-39d1-8a25-9b32d43e3a71;slk:蔣萬安戰沈伯洋！這區最新街頭民調結果跌破眼鏡;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="蔣萬安戰沈伯洋！這區最新街頭民調結果跌破眼鏡" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E6%88%B0%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E9%80%99%E5%8D%80%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E8%A1%97%E9%A0%AD%E6%B0%91%E8%AA%BF%E7%B5%90%E6%9E%9C%E8%B7%8C%E7%A0%B4%E7%9C%BC%E9%8F%A1-122436073.html">蔣萬安戰沈伯洋！這區最新街頭民調結果跌破眼鏡</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">台北市長選戰白熱化，市長蔣萬安競辦今（18日）宣布，台中市長盧秀燕將出任競總主委，引發關注。時常進行街頭民調的YouTube頻道「桃園孫先生」今天在台北市中山區進行街頭民調，結果顯示，沈伯洋領先蔣萬安10票。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">中天新聞網 ・ 22 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>128<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/83BC3160EE4A0F9AFAF00239D9DC6D8D59EC4C91E2B9632FBE866F69E826022B/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftnn_com_tw_939%2F33d1f95f70e12fa62cc0567f3f5ba2e6.jpg"/><img alt="洋流有望現「變天盤」？台北市長最新民調明公布　戴立安預言「仍有落差」" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/970D7FE0496867D62248E586959143D660794D658C816B9B0E3BC2EA2B12A1BA/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftnn_com_tw_939%2F33d1f95f70e12fa62cc0567f3f5ba2e6.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;3133ced5-69b3-3881-9c0d-4a7404cd13eb&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:21,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;洋流有望現「變天盤」？台北市長最新民調明公布　戴立安預言「仍有落差」&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:21;ct:story;g:3133ced5-69b3-3881-9c0d-4a7404cd13eb;slk:洋流有望現「變天盤」？台北市長最新民調明公布　戴立安預言「仍有落差」;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="洋流有望現「變天盤」？台北市長最新民調明公布　戴立安預言「仍有落差」" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81%E6%9C%89%E6%9C%9B%E7%8F%BE-%E8%AE%8A%E5%A4%A9%E7%9B%A4-%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%97%E5%B8%82%E9%95%B7%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E6%B0%91%E8%AA%BF%E6%98%8E%E5%85%AC%E5%B8%83-%E6%88%B4%E7%AB%8B%E5%AE%89%E9%A0%90%E8%A8%80-%E4%BB%8D%E6%9C%89%E8%90%BD%E5%B7%AE-065800955.html">洋流有望現「變天盤」？台北市長最新民調明公布　戴立安預言「仍有落差」</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">[FTNN新聞網]記者胡家銘／台北報導九合一選戰倒數，台北市長選情成全國最熱焦點，爭取連任的台北市長蔣萬安市政爭議不斷，民進黨台北市長候選人沈伯洋以「洋...</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">FTNN新聞網 ・ 4 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>56<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-5 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/365554FE4971F1C6FD5D71A2862BE12ED0BB59772133886F580E88282F849302/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F820f6372fc66a6f5ab034ff79586a3ec.jpg"/><img alt="徐巧芯「猛開戰沈伯洋」遭反殺！本土女歌手看不下去甩1句大痛擊" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/EC560C92651E17F24190A3E6DE31F234775BE2BA681A3100B7DB9C28637DF8D9/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F820f6372fc66a6f5ab034ff79586a3ec.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;3c3fb3f6-fbcd-3edb-9a26-b24d4cfebe33&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:23,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;徐巧芯「猛開戰沈伯洋」遭反殺！本土女歌手看不下去甩1句大痛擊&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:23;ct:story;g:3c3fb3f6-fbcd-3edb-9a26-b24d4cfebe33;slk:徐巧芯「猛開戰沈伯洋」遭反殺！本土女歌手看不下去甩1句大痛擊;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="徐巧芯「猛開戰沈伯洋」遭反殺！本土女歌手看不下去甩1句大痛擊" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%BE%90%E5%B7%A7%E8%8A%AF-%E7%8C%9B%E9%96%8B%E6%88%B0%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E9%81%AD%E5%8F%8D%E6%AE%BA-%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%9F%E5%A5%B3%E6%AD%8C%E6%89%8B%E7%9C%8B%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%8B%E5%8E%BB%E7%94%A91%E5%8F%A5%E5%A4%A7%E7%97%9B%E6%93%8A-020328563.html">徐巧芯「猛開戰沈伯洋」遭反殺！本土女歌手看不下去甩1句大痛擊</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">政治中心／綜合報導2026台北市長選戰持續升溫，國民黨立委徐巧芯18日受訪時，將矛頭指向民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋，批評他擔任立委期間沒有為台北市爭取建設，甚至直指沈伯洋「沒有政績、只有人設」，沒想到，相關言論曝光後，歌手謝和弦的妻子陳緗妮也在臉書發文，翻出沈伯洋過去擔任不分區立委的責任區其實是花蓮縣，發文反問：「徐巧芯為什麼要問沈伯洋為台北市做了什麼？蛤？？？？」。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">民視 ・ 9 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>187<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/040FA89B9E9B79E3C3ACDC6095C5143E123B3943953CD3D9D5ABA5DCFDFD0C9E/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F6c42e63403c0df12b7c31ad63e7f350e.jpg"/><img alt="深藍外省第三代「決定改投沈伯洋」！女子曝1關鍵：蔣萬安竟不知四獸山" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/A3BEB2B1C25296445C0E13D81A76B88B342E4A70B6BEF1F2E6399F4D9A0DA090/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F6c42e63403c0df12b7c31ad63e7f350e.jpg"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;a124ad9b-b2df-36bc-b7d9-78d7e5a2009c&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:24,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;深藍外省第三代「決定改投沈伯洋」！女子曝1關鍵：蔣萬安竟不知四獸山&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:24;ct:story;g:a124ad9b-b2df-36bc-b7d9-78d7e5a2009c;slk:深藍外省第三代「決定改投沈伯洋」！女子曝1關鍵：蔣萬安竟不知四獸山;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="深藍外省第三代「決定改投沈伯洋」！女子曝1關鍵：蔣萬安竟不知四獸山" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B7%B1%E8%97%8D%E5%A4%96%E7%9C%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%BB%A3-%E6%B1%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%94%B9%E6%8A%95%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B-%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E6%9B%9D1%E9%97%9C%E9%8D%B5-%E8%94%A3%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%89%E7%AB%9F%E4%B8%8D%E7%9F%A5%E5%9B%9B%E7%8D%B8%E5%B1%B1-022800500.html">深藍外省第三代「決定改投沈伯洋」！女子曝1關鍵：蔣萬安竟不知四獸山</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">2026台北市長選戰白熱化，尋求連任的蔣萬安與民進黨參選人沈伯洋競爭激烈。近日傳出深藍選區的外省第三代民眾「票投轉向」，表態改支持沈伯洋。該名民眾指出，主因在於蔣萬安先前竟答不出信義區著名的「四獸山」包含哪四座山，讓身為在地居民的她感到相當錯愕與失望。此外，談及近期發生的兒虐事件時，她也哽咽表示市民期望看到領導者能真正站出來承擔家長心聲，成為社會的安全後盾。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">三立新聞網 setn.com ・ 8 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>195<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] lg:h-[140px]"><picture class="mr-4 h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0804C7059293F866E66B7B46F08B5EFC79168DBE007A2575E971324B7A409C71/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmnews_tw_258%2Ffcf130133094aa3a5cee2adc8200d6f2"/><img alt="按摩又擁抱！　美女里長控遭性騷　親密畫面曝光｜#鏡新聞" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-110 aspect-square lg:aspect-video h-[100%]" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/CA47FBE650FD6137C8E6E6910CFA6ACE69312EDB22294986F185D7F08BFD9097/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmnews_tw_258%2Ffcf130133094aa3a5cee2adc8200d6f2"/></picture><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;video&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;39f86282-2d60-324c-81e5-b4969f03c47f&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:25,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;按摩又擁抱！　美女里長控遭性騷　親密畫面曝光｜#鏡新聞&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:25;ct:video;g:39f86282-2d60-324c-81e5-b4969f03c47f;slk:按摩又擁抱！　美女里長控遭性騷　親密畫面曝光｜#鏡新聞;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="按摩又擁抱！　美女里長控遭性騷　親密畫面曝光｜#鏡新聞" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%8C%89%E6%91%A9%E5%8F%88%E6%93%81%E6%8A%B1-%E7%BE%8E%E5%A5%B3%E9%87%8C%E9%95%B7%E6%8E%A7%E9%81%AD%E6%80%A7%E9%A8%B7-%E8%A6%AA%E5%AF%86%E7%95%AB%E9%9D%A2%E6%9B%9D%E5%85%89-%E9%8F%A1%E6%96%B0%E8%81%9E-101504223.html">按摩又擁抱！　美女里長控遭性騷　親密畫面曝光｜#鏡新聞</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">台北市萬華華江里里長洪佳君，今年二月控告環南市場自治會會長林勝東，對她權勢性騷擾，台北地檢署日前偵結，起訴林勝東，並求刑一年。不過10/19鏡週刊卻爆出，兩人其實在案發前互動十分親密，不僅曾相擁、按摩，洪佳君還曾收受昂貴飾品禮物。對此，洪佳君出面澄清，強調兩人絕無私情，關係好絕不代表就可以性騷擾。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">鏡新聞 ・ 56 分鐘前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>1<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="stream-card stream-taboola-ad mb-5 h-[92px] lg:mb-4 lg:h-[140px]" id=""></div><div class="stream-card group hover:bg-main-level-1 relative flex w-full last:mb-0 mb-5 min-h-[60px] lg:mb-4 lg:min-h-[104px] h-auto lg:h-auto"><div class="grow basis-0"><h3 class="text-batcave group-hover:text-brand-yahoo-purple line-clamp-2 font-bold text-px16 lg:text-px20"><a data-yga="{&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;692a79ae-cf15-3865-9211-e7afb833664e&quot;,&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:27,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;「洋流」曇花一現？命理師預言結局：待潮水褪去之後&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;hdln&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;strm-1&quot;}" data-ylk="cpos:27;ct:story;g:692a79ae-cf15-3865-9211-e7afb833664e;slk:「洋流」曇花一現？命理師預言結局：待潮水褪去之後;elm:hdln;sec:rel-stories;subsec:strm-1;" aria-label="「洋流」曇花一現？命理師預言結局：待潮水褪去之後" class="after:tw-stretched-box" href="https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%8B%E6%B5%81-%E6%9B%87%E8%8A%B1-%E7%8F%BE-%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%B8%AB%E9%A0%90%E8%A8%80%E7%B5%90%E5%B1%80-%E5%BE%85%E6%BD%AE%E6%B0%B4%E8%A4%AA%E5%8E%BB%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%8C-131008526.html">「洋流」曇花一現？命理師預言結局：待潮水褪去之後</a></h3><p class="text-px16 text-dolphin my-1 line-clamp-2 wrap-anywhere">民進黨台北市長參選人沈伯洋掀起「洋流」，他日前接受媒體專訪，當場拿出隨身攜帶的塔羅牌，親自替選戰最後40多天的發展占卜。針對「洋流」，命理專家、吠陀占星權威李靜唯表示，熱鬧的浪花或許能博得一時的關注，但潮水褪去之後，唯有禁得起泥土檢驗的踏實治理與寬容厚度，才能真正承載一座城市的未來。。</p><div class="text-px12 text-dolphin mt-1 font-normal flex"><span class="line-clamp-1">中時新聞網 ・ 22 小時前</span> ・ <span class="text-px12 text-dolphin inline-block font-normal whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="text-primary flex-none mr-1 mb-0.5 inline-block h-3 w-3"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>26<span class="sr-only">則留言</span></span></div></div></div><div class="mb-6 lg:mb-3" id="stream-loadmore-placeholder"></div></div></div></section></div></main><div class="mt-module-gap lg:w-article-aside w-full shrink-0 lg:mt-0"><div class=""><aside><div class="mx-auto text-center hidden lg:block mb-module-gap min-w-[300px] min-h-[600px]" id="sda-top-right-iframe">
        <div
          class="text-px12 text-dolphin bg-dirty-seagull mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[600px]"
        >
          廣告
