quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2F1400_3804.png\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/D9F39F2D5412C9AA01954448A98895F4CFD712E20A5FAF37DA670CA7B767732C/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2F1400_3804.png\",\"width\":184}],\"url\":\"https://d29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net/images/user-uploaded/1400_3804.png\"},\"summary\":\"氣象專家吳德榮今天（19日）表示，強颱薔琵續增強、擴大，預計今、明兩天即達顛峰。歐洲模式模擬，薔琵可能登陸或自台灣近海北轉，強風豪雨的威脅絕不可小覷；今明兩天西晴東偶雨，21、22日東北季風影響，氣溫逐日下降。\",\"overrideTitle\":\"颱風薔琵結構紮實颱風眼清晰可見 估最快周三深夜發布海警\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"title\":\"颱風薔琵結構紮實颱風眼清晰可見 估最快周三深夜發布海警\",\"uuid\":\"14fc8cf1-7543-43ee-85d6-72f0bc5753a8\",\"isLiveBlog\":false}},{\"asset\":{\"assetAttributes\":{\"modifiedTime\":\"2026-10-18T23:16:00Z\"},\"contentAttributes\":{\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%BF%97%E5%B7%A5%E8%8A%B18%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88%E6%B8%85%E4%B8%8A%E5%99%B8%E6%B2%B3%E6%B5%81%E5%9E%83%E5%9C%BE-%E5%9B%9E%E9%A0%AD%E7%9C%8B%E5%B4%A9%E6%BD%B0-%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%85%A8%E7%99%BD%E8%B2%BB%E4%BA%86-231600996.html\",\"canvassCommentCount\":39,\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%BF%97%E5%B7%A5%E8%8A%B18%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88%E6%B8%85%E4%B8%8A%E5%99%B8%E6%B2%B3%E6%B5%81%E5%9E%83%E5%9C%BE-%E5%9B%9E%E9%A0%AD%E7%9C%8B%E5%B4%A9%E6%BD%B0-%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%85%A8%E7%99%BD%E8%B2%BB%E4%BA%86-231600996.html\",\"description\":null,\"isHosted\":true,\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\"},\"publishTime\":\"2026-10-18T23:16:00Z\",\"thumbnail\":{\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/F50A4D4E64F324936A985C8D73A65AEBEE38B15340BC3C17CF02B84165ACE137/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fecf1aab06aa350c04078a75aef0836da.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4DC4E5C87173CA84A881849FF615140C5CCAE5211806FF69B2DBC7227AAAF2BC/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fecf1aab06aa350c04078a75aef0836da.jpg\",\"width\":184}],\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/setn.com.tw/ecf1aab06aa350c04078a75aef0836da.jpg\"},\"summary\":\"印度中央邦環保志工喬杜里花費八個多月，徒手將布滿垃圾的阿傑納爾河清理乾淨，重現清澈河水並獲政府讚賞。未料僅過一個月，河道再度被大量垃圾填滿，讓他的心血付諸流水。喬杜里對此感到極度無奈，但強調不會放棄，並發文尋求更有效的清理方案。事件曝光後引發當地民眾熱議，紛紛呼籲政府加強公民意識教育與罰則，杜絕隨意丟棄垃圾的惡習。\",\"overrideTitle\":\"志工花8個月清上噸河流垃圾　回頭看崩潰：工作全白費了\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"title\":\"志工花8個月清上噸河流垃圾　回頭看崩潰：工作全白費了\",\"uuid\":\"52359127-e447-35a3-a941-2a55f1656544\",\"isLiveBlog\":false}},{\"asset\":{\"assetAttributes\":{\"modifiedTime\":\"2026-10-19T06:06:00Z\"},\"contentAttributes\":{\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%96%94%E7%90%B5%E9%A2%B1%E9%A2%A8%E6%9C%80%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%B1%E5%9B%9B%E7%99%BC%E6%B5%B7%E8%AD%A6-%E5%8C%97%E8%BD%89%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%91-%E5%88%863%E6%B4%BE-%E5%85%A8%E5%8F%B0%E6%85%8E%E9%98%B2%E9%A2%A8%E9%9B%A8-060600322.html\",\"canvassCommentCount\":78,\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%96%94%E7%90%B5%E9%A2%B1%E9%A2%A8%E6%9C%80%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%B1%E5%9B%9B%E7%99%BC%E6%B5%B7%E8%AD%A6-%E5%8C%97%E8%BD%89%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%91-%E5%88%863%E6%B4%BE-%E5%85%A8%E5%8F%B0%E6%85%8E%E9%98%B2%E9%A2%A8%E9%9B%A8-060600322.html\",\"description\":null,\"isHosted\":true,\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"上報\"},\"publishTime\":\"2026-10-19T06:06:00Z\",\"thumbnail\":{\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3A78A7BFDB5C58E705E286A33316C5801FB889DF3B2053FAE8E5C394DCE00B3B/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fupmedia.mg.tw%2F5c2ec9ff808c6488076a2e1e474f284f.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E68A0A7488FFD5BFE91281F066DEC9DA4E3C4952E568B4794D7CB95C8AF72A82/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fupmedia.mg.tw%2F5c2ec9ff808c6488076a2e1e474f284f.jpg\",\"width\":184}],\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/upmedia.mg.tw/5c2ec9ff808c6488076a2e1e474f284f.jpg\"},\"summary\":\"今年第29號颱風「薔琵」（Champi）持續向台灣附近海域靠近。氣象粉專「台灣颱風論壇｜天氣特急」今（19日）指出，強颱薔琵在經歷眼牆置換與乾空氣捲入後，核心結構正重新建立，原本模糊\",\"overrideTitle\":\"薔琵颱風最快週四發海警　北轉路徑「分3派」全台慎防風雨\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"title\":\"薔琵颱風最快週四發海警　北轉路徑「分3派」全台慎防風雨\",\"uuid\":\"c69fd3b9-07ec-315d-9cc0-7c5c47e4b082\",\"isLiveBlog\":false}},{\"asset\":{\"assetAttributes\":{\"modifiedTime\":\"2026-10-18T10:18:00Z\"},\"contentAttributes\":{\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%80%A5%E5%B0%8B4%E5%BC%B5%E5%8D%83%E8%90%AC%E7%99%BC%E7%A5%A8%E5%BE%97%E4%B8%BB-%E6%B6%88%E8%B2%BB%E5%9C%B0%E9%BB%9E%E6%9B%9D%E5%85%89-11-5%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E7%8D%8E%E9%87%91%E5%85%A8%E5%85%85%E5%85%AC-101800514.html\",\"canvassCommentCount\":24,\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%80%A5%E5%B0%8B4%E5%BC%B5%E5%8D%83%E8%90%AC%E7%99%BC%E7%A5%A8%E5%BE%97%E4%B8%BB-%E6%B6%88%E8%B2%BB%E5%9C%B0%E9%BB%9E%E6%9B%9D%E5%85%89-11-5%E9%80%BE%E6%9C%9F%E7%8D%8E%E9%87%91%E5%85%A8%E5%85%85%E5%85%AC-101800514.html\",\"description\":null,\"isHosted\":true,\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"壹蘋新聞網\"},\"publishTime\":\"2026-10-18T10:18:00Z\",\"thumbnail\":{\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5BCA737FBD77465652238890B9E4DE0F1F71BE1CACF3D6E6F1F65CED3092AF80/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fnextapple_com_761%2F929ded5b11df5e7219493ea26a731d3d\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/82B2936FA2342731216F50AEF5C5F5C3B23DC4AF338EA16D44A3C79380989CEF/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fnextapple_com_761%2F929ded5b11df5e7219493ea26a731d3d\",\"width\":184}],\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/nextapple_com_761/929ded5b11df5e7219493ea26a731d3d\"},\"summary\":\"【王宇德／台北報導】財政部統計，2026年5、6月期統一發票千萬元特別獎，至今仍有4張尚未兌領，領獎期限至11月5日止，逾期未領獎金將全數充公。4張中獎發票消費金額介於150元至620元，消費地點涵蓋台北市、新北市、苗栗縣及雲林縣，提醒民眾趕緊翻找發票、檢查電子信箱及雲端載具，別讓千萬元財富擦身而過。\",\"overrideTitle\":\"急尋4張千萬發票得主！消費地點曝光　11/5逾期獎金全充公\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"title\":\"急尋4張千萬發票得主！消費地點曝光　11/5逾期獎金全充公\",\"uuid\":\"7953f973-1f49-3012-8cdd-8d0a07c767d2\",\"isLiveBlog\":false}}],\"sportsCardData\":\"$undefined\",\"stockSymbols\":[]},\"isLineApp\":false,\"navigationList\":[{\"name\":\"焦點\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/\",\"children\":[{\"name\":\"AI 事件整理\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/news-story/\",\"badge\":\"\",\"openInNewTab\":false,\"isFooterItem\":false},{\"name\":\"Yahoo畫重點\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/topic/explains/\"},{\"name\":\"熱門新聞\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/most-popular/\"},{\"name\":\"天氣\",\"url\":\"https://weather.yahoo.com/zh-hant-tw/\",\"badge\":\"\",\"openInNewTab\":false,\"isFooterItem\":false},{\"name\":\"民調\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/poll/\",\"badge\":\"\",\"openInNewTab\":false,\"isFooterItem\":false},{\"name\":\"專輯\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/topic/\",\"badge\":\"\",\"openInNewTab\":false,\"isFooterItem\":false},{\"name\":\"合作媒體\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/provider/\"}]},{\"name\":\"即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/archive/\",\"children\":[{\"name\":\"娛樂即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/entertainment/archive/\"},{\"name\":\"國際即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/world/archive/\"},{\"name\":\"政治即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/politics/archive/\"},{\"name\":\"社會即時\",\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/socie