ourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T22:28:54Z\",\"summary\":\"由永齡基金會主辦、曾馨瑩主理的「永齡銘馨盃」舞蹈大賽邁入第四屆，據悉，16歲的女兒妞妞過去只是插花演出，今年開始加入主導賽事，還傳出正撮合爸爸郭台銘與媽媽曾馨瑩同台，希望促成爸媽世紀破冰。因為孩子而重新思考婚姻、試圖修補家庭關係的例子，在演藝圈也曾發生過。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/mirrormedia.mg/2bf5be667f1a1483043d1b52b5796b97.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/BDF6A816577039D64E4BC8C7F6D7FB9A529BACEC2E463B4A892F4608C6B2ADEA/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2F2bf5be667f1a1483043d1b52b5796b97.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/821F34A34EEFBAB730A0A42F3479F983A886416E6CD1F8DF9234AA2D3394C4AD/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fmirrormedia.mg%2F2bf5be667f1a1483043d1b52b5796b97.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"為兒子再給老公一次機會　女星懷二胎4年後還是離婚了\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"f8dcc3ff-96ea-3b1d-bd73-ae404ded7e8c\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%94%A1%E5%BA%B7%E6%B0%B8%E9%A9%9A%E5%82%B3-%E4%B8%BB%E5%8B%95%E5%91%8A%E5%88%A5%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%B8%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4-%E8%A2%AB%E7%88%86%E5%88%AA%E9%99%A4%E5%B0%8D%E5%B2%B8%E7%B6%93%E7%B4%80%E4%BA%BA%E8%81%AF%E7%B9%AB%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F-005659160.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":178},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%94%A1%E5%BA%B7%E6%B0%B8%E9%A9%9A%E5%82%B3-%E4%B8%BB%E5%8B%95%E5%91%8A%E5%88%A5%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%B8%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4-%E8%A2%AB%E7%88%86%E5%88%AA%E9%99%A4%E5%B0%8D%E5%B2%B8%E7%B6%93%E7%B4%80%E4%BA%BA%E8%81%AF%E7%B9%AB%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F-005659160.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"dbebdd01-5fa2-3c6d-8482-01fb4eaa1f28\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"蔡康永驚傳「主動告別大陸市場」！被爆刪除對岸經紀人聯繫方式\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"中天新聞網\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T00:56:59Z\",\"summary\":\"主持人蔡康永近日出席沈伯洋的選舉造勢活動引發網路熱議，微博隨後傳出他已刪除大陸經紀人聯絡方式，外界猜測他可能淡出大陸市場。截至目前，蔡康永本人尚未對相關傳聞公開回應，傳聞是否屬實仍有待他進一步說明。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/gotv_ctitv_com_tw_678/2d0f85056b9c1e6e3e511f26bacb8274.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E92781BBD614F09225B60923B629DB94D4A19DD1EEFC535B6E00CCD329199717/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F2d0f85056b9c1e6e3e511f26bacb8274.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4FBAC2E7EE5AB0740AF3AE39EA7EC82A43C6DC7D846C1EE894C45157056B0B53/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2F2d0f85056b9c1e6e3e511f26bacb8274.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"蔡康永驚傳「主動告別大陸市場」！被爆刪除對岸經紀人聯繫方式\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"dbebdd01-5fa2-3c6d-8482-01fb4eaa1f28\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B7%AA%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%98%BF%E5%AC%A4%E6%98%AF%E8%87%A8%E6%BC%94-%E4%BD%9C%E5%AE%B6%E6%9B%9D%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%BA%AB%E5%88%86-6%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%8A%E8%A1%97%E4%BA%86-232805920.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":438},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B7%AA%E6%B2%88%E4%BC%AF%E6%B4%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%98%BF%E5%AC%A4%E6%98%AF%E8%87%A8%E6%BC%94-%E4%BD%9C%E5%AE%B6%E6%9B%9D%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%BA%AB%E5%88%86-6%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%8A%E8%A1%97%E4%BA%86-232805920.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"0fb2dac5-d08b-39ae-8c23-74088a4ec958\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"跪沈伯洋的阿嬤是臨演？作家曝真實身分：6年前就上街了\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"中時新聞網\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T23:28:05Z\",\"summary\":\"民進黨台北市長候選人沈伯洋17日前往社子島參加活動，一名阿嬤突然下跪陳情，哭求沈伯洋當選後協助當地居民，未料畫面曝光後，卻遭部分網友質疑是事先安排的「臨時演員」，引發議論。對此，作家「漂浪島嶼」18日發文揭露，這名洪姓阿嬤早在6年前、蔣萬安尚未當選台北市長時，就已跟隨反徵收自救會上街抗爭，並非所謂的臨演。他更感嘆，為了保住家園，「別說下跪陳情，趴在地上都是願意」，但也直言，無論蔣萬安或沈伯洋，都未真正回應居民反對徵收的核心訴求。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/chinatimes.com.tw/951e7931de4e00f5406a67e4187c20a6.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B77B358A9F73C175FBC7952EEB7A111AF994DDCD4C7052CFD3F26561293033CE/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fchinatimes.com.tw%2F951e7931de4e00f5406a67e4187c20a6.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/A1411F833B0274B2A01E4092BD357989D92B679453561E9E5CB434AF4855A746/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fchinatimes.com.tw%2F951e7931de4e00f5406a67e4187c20a6.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"跪沈伯洋的阿嬤是臨演？作家曝真實身分：6年前就上街了\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"0fb2dac5-d08b-39ae-8c23-74088a4ec958\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%97%8D%E5%BF%83%E6%B9%84%E8%AD%B7%E8%88%AA%E8%B3%88%E6%B0%B8%E5%A9%95%E5%9C%8B%E6%9C%83%E7%A9%BF%E6%90%AD-%E6%94%BE%E9%81%8E%E9%98%BF%E5%A7%A8%E5%90%A7-012405631.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":58},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E8%97%8D%E5%BF%83%E6%B9%84%E8%AD%B7%E8%88%AA%E8%B3%88%E6%B0%B8%E5%A9%95%E5%9C%8B%E6%9C%83%E7%A9%BF%E6%90%AD-%E6%94%BE%E9%81%8E%E9%98%BF%E5%A7%A8%E5%90%A7-012405631.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"44bf9ee0-50f3-3b6c-8217-c89fc9007947\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"藍心湄護航賈永婕國會穿搭　「放過阿姨吧」\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"太報\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-17T01:24:05Z\",\"summary\":\"藍心湄昨（10╱16）出席TVBS《女人我最大》2026「女人我最大賞」頒獎典禮，被問到賈永婕日前在國會被民進黨籍召委賴惠員要求開會時應穿著「純樸」一事，她幽默笑說：「我跟她一樣喜歡愛馬仕（Hermès）腰帶，阿姨所見略同，大家就放過阿姨吧！」\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/taisounds_com_380/31c343445c62344912cd58b26ee31c57.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/216EC16D118279EC77F1697B25748EF78AA29AB9964ABED103895C13B79C4CE4/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Ftaisounds_com_380%2F31c343445c62344912cd58b26ee31c57.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/FE0FCEC8A5D03AF559EF0B4CC9858205A138B53439016B539F50E1C056B550BD/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Ftaisounds_com_380%2F31c343445c62344912cd58b26ee31c57.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"藍心湄護航賈永婕國會穿搭　「放過阿姨吧」\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"44bf9ee0-50f3-3b6c-8217-c89fc9007947\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%87%91%E9%90%98%E5%B0%88%E8%A8%AA-%E8%88%92%E8%8F%AF%E9%9A%BB%E8%BA%AB%E8%B5%B4%E9%9F%93%E9%97%96%E8%95%A9-%E6%9B%BE%E5%AF%B6%E5%84%80%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E8%A7%80%E8%BD%89%E8%AE%8A-%E8%87%AA%E6%9B%9D%E7%8F%BE%E5%9C%A8%E5%8F%AA%E6%B1%82-4%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B-232825757.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":5},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%87%91%E9%90%98%E5%B0%88%E8%A8%AA-%E8%88%92%E8%8F%AF%E9%9A%BB%E8%BA%AB%E8%B5%B4%E9%9F%93%E9%97%96%E8%95%A9-%E6%9B%BE%E5%AF%B6%E5%84%80%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E8%A7%80%E8%BD%89%E8%AE%8A-%E8%87%AA%E6%9B%9D%E7%8F%BE%E5%9C%A8%E5%8F%AA%E6%B1%82-4%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B-232825757.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"f69d759d-180b-388f-b33c-2de9f101d955\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"（金鐘專訪）舒華隻身赴韓闖蕩！曾寶儀人生觀轉變 自曝現在只求「4件事」\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"自由時報\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-18T23:28:25Z\",\"summary\":\"家，一定要得到父母認同才算數嗎？曾寶儀陪著《我們回家吧》的來賓回望成長、走進生活，也逐漸找到自己的答案。今年《我們回家吧3》入圍第61屆金鐘獎「生活風格節目獎」，她也角逐「生活風格節目主持人獎」。談起節目帶來的體會，她以隻身在韓國闖蕩的舒華為例，提醒每個尋找歸屬的人：「家裡最重要的成員是你自己。」\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/libertytimes_786/9eff0eb69e7fc45a294807003fa28662.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/AA23F1CD80A2ADA60B24B2D4FD0BC82FE8A48B03B90F117D98ABB4AC5758B8D8/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Flibertytimes_786%2F9eff0eb69e7fc45a294807003fa28662.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B0CF5A36953728AF5CAEC47587EE855A50115727C8F6AA21364F52AA1D7DA78C/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Flibertytimes_786%2F9eff0eb69e7fc45a294807003fa28662.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"（金鐘專訪）舒華隻身赴韓闖蕩！曾寶儀人生觀轉變 自曝現在只求「4件事」\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"f69d759d-180b-388f-b33c-2de9f101d955\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%97%E8%85%B3%E6%B0%B4-%E8%91%89%E8%98%8A%E5%84%80%E6%97%85%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A31%E5%B9%B4-%E9%A9%9A%E5%98%86%E9%80%99%E8%A3%A1-%E9%9D%88%E6%B0%A3%E6%BB%BF%E6%BB%BF-031217943.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":14},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B4%97%E8%85%B3%E6%B0%B4-%E8%91%89%E8%98%8A%E5%84%80%E6%97%85%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A31%E5%B9%B4-%E9%A9%9A%E5%98%86%E9%80%99%E8%A3%A1-%E9%9D%88%E6%B0%A3%E6%BB%BF%E6%BB%BF-031217943.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"585e616a-2720-36bc-90cf-da9a4bfba33f\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"「洗腳水」葉蘊儀旅居台灣1年！驚嘆這裡：靈氣滿滿\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"民視\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T03:12:17Z\",\"summary\":\"娛樂中心／陳韋如報導昔日以廣東國語「19歲（洗腳水）」紅遍大街小巷的甜美偶像葉蘊儀，近日接受媒體訪問，直言私底下的自己「其實沒那麼可愛」。真實的她個性嚴謹且獨立，熱愛隻身一人前往不同國家深度旅居，在體驗過澳洲、法國與英國當地生活後，近期她更悄悄來台長住近一年，除了發展個人的陶藝事業，她也深深迷上台灣自然風光，徹底愛上壯麗靈秀的合歡山。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/ftvn.com.tw/77afbc56608c210bbdb3bf44f3c0ab7e.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/05310DCE64B3D53E2AA573E276391E15EC725D28B71466B2D0F0A484F6981B7E/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F77afbc56608c210bbdb3bf44f3c0ab7e.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5553DA809359E1BF909FF5BDC8D2B85CF76CC0C7D8FEBE7F024FDA8002E7862D/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F77afbc56608c210bbdb3bf44f3c0ab7e.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"「洗腳水」葉蘊儀旅居台灣1年！驚嘆這裡：靈氣滿滿\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"585e616a-2720-36bc-90cf-da9a4bfba33f\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E7%9D%BD%E9%81%957%E5%B9%B4%E5%85%AC%E9%96%8B%E9%9C%B2%E9%9D%A2-%E4%B8%81%E5%B0%8F%E8%8A%B9%E5%87%BA%E7%8D%84-%E8%BD%89%E6%88%B0%E9%9B%BB%E5%95%86-%E9%96%8B%E5%95%9F%E4%BA%8B%E6%A5%AD%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%A5-045200910.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":22},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E7%9D%BD%E9%81%957%E5%B9%B4%E5%85%AC%E9%96%8B%E9%9C%B2%E9%9D%A2-%E4%B8%81%E5%B0%8F%E8%8A%B9%E5%87%BA%E7%8D%84-%E8%BD%89%E6%88%B0%E9%9B%BB%E5%95%86-%E9%96%8B%E5%95%9F%E4%BA%8B%E6%A5%AD%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%A5-045200910.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"aeb3ae3b-81f0-39e2-b260-6565911bda56\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"睽違7年公開露面！丁小芹出獄「轉戰電商」開啟事業第二春\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"EBC東森娛樂\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T04:52:00Z\",\"summary\":\"睽違7年公開露面！丁小芹出獄「轉戰電商」開啟事業第二春\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/ebc_star_440/b55590ed6d9d60ac864c61214fc460e3.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/64A28FFFA3470C8E94CD65003FAAB8C3D947586B2F80B0020C9CDCFEE88D7756/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Febc_star_440%2Fb55590ed6d9d60ac864c61214fc460e3.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/DF9D88BFFAA16A7F203BAE7A345C95207E4CA39B23F5D23D9CE8E31B1005C152/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Febc_star_440%2Fb55590ed6d9d60ac864c61214fc460e3.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"睽違7年公開露面！丁小芹出獄「轉戰電商」開啟事業第二春\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"aeb3ae3b-81f0-39e2-b260-6565911bda56\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%A2%81%E6%9C%9D%E5%81%89-%E5%8A%89%E5%98%89%E7%8E%B2%E5%90%8C%E6%A1%86%E8%91%9B%E8%90%8A%E7%BE%8E%E5%A4%A9%E7%8E%8B-%E7%B6%B2%E7%9C%8B%E5%82%BB-%E4%BB%A5%E7%82%BA%E6%98%AFai-050038445.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":2},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%A2%81%E6%9C%9D%E5%81%89-%E5%8A%89%E5%98%89%E7%8E%B2%E5%90%8C%E6%A1%86%E8%91%9B%E8%90%8A%E7%BE%8E%E5%A4%A9%E7%8E%8B-%E7%B6%B2%E7%9C%8B%E5%82%BB-%E4%BB%A5%E7%82%BA%E6%98%AFai-050038445.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"aa78907a-5e89-3d34-9a0f-f20f83958e75\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"梁朝偉、劉嘉玲同框葛萊美天王！網看傻：以為是AI\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"民視\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T05:00:38Z\",\"summary\":\"娛樂中心／陳韋如報導加拿大流行天王威肯（The Weeknd）日前飛抵香港，為即將登場的「After Hours Til Dawn」世界巡迴演唱會預熱。令人驚喜的是，影后劉嘉玲當晚無預警在社群曬出與丈夫梁朝偉、威肯的三人合照，威肯不僅在貼文下方留言，還用另一個官方帳號分享與梁朝偉聊天的側拍照，搭配王菲經典歌曲《夢中人》，瞬間在影迷與樂迷圈掀起轟動，網友紛紛來朝聖「兩個世界的巨星頂峰相會」、「嚇爛！以為是AI」。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/ftvn.com.tw/714e18e778c6e7cb976f1d5556624c6f.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/34F00BF20DDCCC5B167C024504DA62F2ED64682C3D64EC9EC1ABF4E65A96BB8F/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F714e18e778c6e7cb976f1d5556624c6f.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/03A64D6ECEF01C26A3FE2242CE3E57504344EEB99475C09C598A8A0BC07B4EFC/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F714e18e778c6e7cb976f1d5556624c6f.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"梁朝偉、劉嘉玲同框葛萊美天王！網看傻：以為是AI\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"aa78907a-5e89-3d34-9a0f-f20f83958e75\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E4%B9%8B%E5%85%89-%E7%94%B7%E6%98%9F-%E8%B5%B4%E6%97%A5%E8%B3%A3%E9%B9%B9%E9%85%A5%E9%9B%9E-%E7%8B%82%E9%96%8B5%E5%88%86%E5%BA%97%E7%99%BB%E4%B8%8Anhk-%E6%95%91%E4%BA%86-031800109.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":116},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E4%B9%8B%E5%85%89-%E7%94%B7%E6%98%9F-%E8%B5%B4%E6%97%A5%E8%B3%A3%E9%B9%B9%E9%85%A5%E9%9B%9E-%E7%8B%82%E9%96%8B5%E5%88%86%E5%BA%97%E7%99%BB%E4%B8%8Anhk-%E6%95%91%E4%BA%86-031800109.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"80f2c10d-6134-3239-9c2a-ca91dbb7061d\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"台灣之光！男星「赴日賣鹹酥雞」狂開5分店登上NHK：救了一條商店街\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-17T03:18:00Z\",\"summary\":\"以經典戲劇《浴火鳳凰》走紅的男星李承泰，淡出演藝圈28年赴日本名古屋創業賣鹹酥雞。日前他與好友王彩樺聚餐，凍齡近況曝光引發熱議。他不僅成功救活瀕臨倒閉的商店街，更擴展5間分店，將大腸麵線等台味發揚光大，多次登上日本NHK等媒體報導，被王彩樺與粉絲大讚是真正的台灣之光。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/zh-tw/setn.com.tw/d30d9a353826d7de58db7dc0698fc923.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ACDE3D77E7F772CD1E3744178616F5EFAD433A8DDAC85492CA2850A52CE64E23/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fd30d9a353826d7de58db7dc0698fc923.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/35F09C17D89C41563FA34DDCAB81CD01B4907B62E6B9814016117C38CE1DF69A/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fsetn.com.tw%2Fd30d9a353826d7de58db7dc0698fc923.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"台灣之光！男星「赴日賣鹹酥雞」狂開5分店登上NHK：救了一條商店街\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"80f2c10d-6134-3239-9c2a-ca91dbb7061d\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9B%BE-%E9%80%B1%E5%BF%996%E5%A4%A9-%E5%B9%B4%E9%81%8E70%E4%BB%8D%E7%A9%A9%E5%81%A5-%E5%90%8D%E9%86%AB%E6%9B%9D%E6%8A%97%E8%80%81%E7%A5%95%E8%A8%A3-%E6%AF%8F%E5%A4%A9%E5%81%9A4%E4%BA%8B-065300869.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":3},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9B%BE-%E9%80%B1%E5%BF%996%E5%A4%A9-%E5%B9%B4%E9%81%8E70%E4%BB%8D%E7%A9%A9%E5%81%A5-%E5%90%8D%E9%86%AB%E6%9B%9D%E6%8A%97%E8%80%81%E7%A5%95%E8%A8%A3-%E6%AF%8F%E5%A4%A9%E5%81%9A4%E4%BA%8B-065300869.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"14e36627-e0cf-31ba-b4fd-a90952b1999d\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"曾一週忙6天　年過70仍穩健！名醫曝抗老祕訣「每天做4事」\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-10-19T06:53:00Z\",\"summary\":\"花蓮慈濟醫院院長林欣榮榮獲第36屆醫療奉獻獎特殊貢獻獎，他行醫近半世紀，專注腦中風與幹細胞研究，帶領團隊創下多項台灣醫療首例。年過70歲的他身體健勇，受訪時大方分享日常抗老秘訣，包含每天早中晚進行深蹲、交叉步、大步走來強化肌力與平衡感，並透過大聲唱歌鍛鍊喉部肌肉以防嗆到，全面提升長者的身體機能與生活安全品質。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.ze